SUMMARY:Indie Film Series 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T193000
DTSTAMP:20260729T034639Z
UID:occ-1230@atlcal.com
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Halloween edition of the monthly indie showcase: shorts and fe
 atures from around the world\, roughly 90 minutes.\n\nA Halloween edition 
 of the monthly indie film night\, a compact festival packing short and fea
 ture-length independent films into a single sitting\, about ninety minutes
  in all. Selections come from emerging and established filmmakers across t
 he country and abroad\, curated for originality and offbeat themes. From t
 he Strand in partnership with the Cobb International Film Festival\; scree
 nings are open to the public.
GEO:33.9536122;-84.5492054
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T204247Z
LOCATION:The Strand Theatre\, 117 N Park Square
